NFS Media Manager

This project is a fork of CSDR Cloud Spatial App, maintained by
SustainableDevelopmentReform:
https://github.com/SustainableDevelopmentReform/csdr-cloud-spatial-app

The fork adapts the Next.js, Hono, authentication, database, shared UI and
workspace foundations into a personal film and album library. It replaces
the spatial-data application with media browsing, imports, provider plugins
and background jobs. Unused spatial, reporting and archived application
code has been removed.

